---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="about - rato's world" currentPage="about">
    <!-- About Section -->
    <section class="content-section" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <h2>[ about ]</h2>
        <div class="about-content">
            <p>hello, i'm <span class="highlight">rato</span>! but, you can call me <span class="highlight">iris</span> too. nice to meet you, fren.</p>
            <p>first of all: why rato? my full goverment name is <span class="highlight">rato punk</span>. people online call me that because of my twitter username, i never intended it to happen, but it just happened, so i went along with it. it's pretty fitting for who i am.</p>
            <p>this is my personal website, i always loved the internet and the possibility of sharing a piece of my mind online, but never had the courage to. right now that i'm older, i realized: who cares? so i did it. i already have socials, but i'm kinda tired of insta, twitter, and the other socials out there (youtube not included).</p>

            <p>i'll try to update this website regularly, i want this to be a safe space for me and who is visiting too.</p>

            <p>i hope you have a nice browsing.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Work & Education Section -->
    <section class="content-section" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <h2>[ work & education ]</h2>
        <div class="about-content">
            <p>i'm a cloud infra engineer, i work with infra development and AI. i like to build front and backend stuff from time to time.</p>
            <p>i'm graduating in computer science in 2025, and i'm currently working as an infra engineer in a tech company from usa.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Things I Like Section -->
    <section class="content-section">
        <h2>[ list of things i love ]</h2>
        <div class="about-content">
            <ul class="love-list">
                <li> - gaming</li>
                <li> - books</li>
                <li> - retro tech</li>
                <li> - cds, dvds, vinyls</li>
                <li> - my girlfriend, natalia</li>
                <li> - my friends</li>
                <li> - my pets</li>
                <li> - my family</li>
                <li> - spending time with people i love</li>
                <li> - skateboard</li>
                <li> - listening to music, playing music</li>
                <li> - watching youtube videos</li>
                <li> - anything horror related</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Back to home button -->
    <div class="back-button-container">
        <button class="retro-button" onclick="window.location.href='/'">
            &larr; BACK TO HOME
        </button>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
